+## Overview
+
+Total revenue is $7,154.44 across 30 orders. The median order value is $204.95. Sales cover four products sold across four regions: North, South, East, and West.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads with $2,392.00 in revenue from just 16 units. Widget follows at $2,118.94 from 106 units, then Doohickey at $1,513.00 from 17. Sprocket moves the most units (238) yet earns the least at $1,130.50.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North leads with $2,176.35, or 30.4% of total revenue, from 8 orders. East follows at $1,830.79, South at $1,732.48, and West trails at $1,414.82 — roughly 35% below North on a near-equal order count of 7.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Prioritize Gadget, the top earner at $2,392.00 from only 16 units; small unit gains there lift revenue most.
+- Diagnose West, the weakest region at $1,414.82 — roughly 35% behind North on near-equal order counts — and test targeted promotions.
+- Reprice or reposition Sprocket: it moves 238 units but returns just $1,130.50, the lowest revenue per unit sold.
